   "share_enabled": false,
   "text": "🚇 Next Station: Strawberry’s Wish 🍓✨\n\nMeet Strawberry’s Wish, the newest Story Bag joining the PinPaint Subway Series, co-created by PinPaint and Tiffany Tan.\nStrawberry’s Wish captures a tiny moment of connection on the subway. Strawberry sits beneath a “Make a Wish” ad as a shooting star passes outside the window, while Persimmon looks up from across the carriage. Together, the scene becomes a story about wishes, timing, and one unexpected glance. 💫\n\nThis new chapter of the Subway Series also comes with a few upgrades made for everyday use:\n✨ Lenticular Ad Panel Card that changes images as you move\n⭕ 3 charm loops for your favorite charms and plushies\n🎀 A wider adjustable shoulder strap for added comfort\n👜 Full interior lining\n🔐 A zippered inner pocket for your small essentials\n\nAnd a little something extra for pre-order passengers: \n🎁 First 30 pre-orders receive a Surprise bag worth $50+\n💗 Enjoy a special launch price for the first 7 days\n📍 Every pre-order comes with an extra Surprise Pin\nStrawberry’s Wish is arriving soon. 🚇🍓\n\nTap the link in bio and hit “Notify Me” so you don’t miss the pre-order launch.\n\nArtist Collaboration 🎨\nPinPaint × Tiffany Tan · @apple.cheeks \n#pinpaint #storybag #subwayseries #artist #artistcollaboration",
   "type": 1
  },
